# Blossombind: "Enchant creature. When this Aura enters, tap enchanted creature. Enchanted creature can't become untapped and can't have counters put on it." Bot1
# enchants Bot2's untapped Ornithopter on turn 3: the trigger taps it, and in Bot2's untap step on turn 4 it stays tapped (CR 502.3, 101.2).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Blossombind
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

[Actions]
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = false
Bot1.Hand.Blossombind.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = true
[T4 Bot2.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Blossombind.AttachedTo = Ornithopter
